WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.831
Start by inspecting the source rows Look for visible
and invisible

00:00:05.858 --> 00:00:11.659
formatting differences Notice missing emails or
phones blank values

00:00:11.804 --> 00:00:17.306
inconsistent punctuation and possible duplicate
people The purpose

00:00:17.332 --> 00:00:22.923
of this first query is not to fix anything It is to
build evidence about

00:00:22.949 --> 00:00:24.792
the source before defining rules
